The **Sukkur Salah** mobile application has been developed to keep you informed about accurate daily prayer timings.
**Sukkur Salah** is a comprehensive and authentic Islamic app. Although its primary purpose is to provide the people of Sukkur with accurate prayer timings, prayer timings for the whole world have been included in this app, which contains numerous features for Muslims all around the world.

**Here are the key features of Sukkur Salah:**

**🕋 Prayer Timings and Location Management**

**Specialized Sukkur Prayer Timings**: Perfectly accurate authentic prayer timings for Sukkur based on the new Jantri by the renowned and authentic Hazrat Dr. Hafeezullah Sahib (Qaddasallahu Sirrahu). You can easily switch to this local mode from the app's sidebar. (You can select Sukkur's timings)
**Specialized Worldwide Prayer Timings**: Now specialized for all cities across the world! While residing or traveling anywhere outside Sukkur, get highly accurate prayer timings for any city in the world using modern calculations.
**Smart Location**: You can manually set your location or allow the app to automatically detect your current location to get prayer timings for any city in the world. Whenever Sukkur is selected (either manually or automatically via current location), the app automatically switches to Sukkur's authentic Jantri by Hazrat Dr. Hafeezullah Sahib (Qaddasallahu Sirrahu), you can select Sukkur timings from the sidebar too, ensuring you always receive the 100% authentic local timings.
**Daily and Monthly Timing Schedule**: View your daily prayer timings or know the schedule in advance with the help of a full monthly calendar.
**Sukkur Masajid Jama'at Times**: (In Sukkur Mode Only) Live, cloud-synchronized congregational (Jama'at) prayer timings for various Masajid across Sukkur, keeping you updated with your local mosque schedule.
**Pre-Jama'at Reminder**: (In Sukkur Mode Only) Timely alerts and reminders before Jama'at begins for your favorite selected mosque so you never miss congregation.
**🔍 Masjid Search Bar**: Easily search any mosque or area across Sukkur in all 10 languages with instant smart multi-language search.
**🎴 Branded Prayer & Jama'at Sharing Cards**: Easily save and share beautifully styled Islamic cards for daily prayer timings (for Sukkur and worldwide cities) and local mosque Jama'at schedules via WhatsApp, social media, or high-res PNG images.

**📖 The Holy Quran and Daily Supplications**

**16-Line Tajweedi Holy Quran**: Recite the Holy Quran in the easy-to-read and authentic 16-line classic format, prepared in accordance with the rules of Tajweed.
**15-Line Tajweedi Holy Quran**: Recite the Holy Quran in the classic 15-line format, prepared in accordance with the rules of Tajweed.
**Authentic Translations**: Recite the Holy Quran with the authentic Urdu and English translations by Shaykh-ul-Islam Hazrat Mufti Taqi Usmani Sahib (Hafizahullah).
**Heartfelt Munajat**: Soul-stirring poetic supplications and Munajat for spiritual reflection and prayers.
**Digital Tasbeeh**: Keep an easy count of your daily Adhkar, Durood Sharif, and Wazaif using the easy-to-use Tasbeeh counter.

**🕌 Reminders, Notifications, and Adhan**

**Prayer Reminders**: Ensure punctuality in congregational prayers. Set timely alerts near the start or end of prayer times.
Selection of Beautiful Adhans: Customize your notifications by selecting your favorite Adhan from beautiful Adhans around the world.
**Auto Silent Mode**: For peaceful worship in the mosque, automatically set your phone to silent mode during prayer times, which will automatically revert to normal volume after the prayer.

**⚙️ Tools and Other Settings**

**Qibla Compass**: A fast and authentic digital compass to find the accurate direction of the Qibla no matter which corner of the world you are in.
**Nearby Masjid Finder**: Easily find nearby mosques with direction and distance from your current location anywhere in the world.
**Islamic Hijri Events**: Important Islamic dates, blessed nights, and Hijri calendar events throughout the year.
**Lock Screen Live Countdown**: Live real-time countdown to the next prayer time right on your phone's lock screen.
**Hijri Calendar Adjustment**: Manually adjust the Hijri date by up to +2 or -2 days to keep the Islamic calendar accurate according to the local moonsighting.
**Date and Time Settings**: Complete control over date formats, time zones, and prayer calculation methods.
**Home Screen Widget**: View the current time and the next prayer time right from your phone's home screen with the help of a beautiful widget.
**Display Customization**: Set the app's interface according to your preference through extensive options.
**Dark and Light Modes**: Easy switching between dark and light modes for the comfort of your eyes.
**Multilingual Support**: Use the app in the language you are comfortable with. Available languages include Urdu, English, Sindhi, Arabic, Persian, Bengali, Hindi, Turkish, French, Indonesian.
The primary purpose of **Sukkur Salah** is to make you punctual in your prayers and help you remain firm with steadfastness in the religion. May Allah Subhanahu Wa Ta'ala accept these efforts of ours and your prayers. Remember us in your daily prayers!

**From: Masjid Babul Islam, Anaj Bazar, Sukkur, Sindh Pakistan**.
